Cell["\<\
h[k] returns a Hermitian Hamiltonian; the nOccupied lowest-energy eigenstates \
are retained at each point after energy sorting.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->2067542830,ExpressionUUID->"8a63b792-15d4-8948-8d81-287f5514ccdb"],

Cell["\<\
The helper closes the path by linking the last sampled occupied subspace back \
to the first, so a repeated endpoint is optional.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1712850558,ExpressionUUID->"1842cbad-a9bb-0a4c-a4b2-189b1545d188"],

Cell["\<\
Returns the sorted Wilson-loop eigenphases multiplied by -1/Pi. Preserve this \
package-specific normalization when comparing to conventions expressed in \
units of 2 Pi.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1324230353,ExpressionUUID->"a53799ba-3a56-ef42-aa3b-0b55b1527950"],

Cell["\<\
A separated occupied subspace and a sufficiently dense path are needed for a \
stable result. Eigensystem options are accepted and Method -> \"Direct\" is \
supplied internally.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->355746608,ExpressionUUID->"9b36c676-b7ba-4043-91ad-a33473c2e2cb"]
}, Closed]],

