Cell["\<\
The occupied eigenstate of a constant Hamiltonian has zero phase around a \
square loop.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->1217011067,ExpressionUUID->"a76d5807-1980-9147-b75e-4c47044ab05c"],

